{"caption":"","data":"@FSC.exists_padded_unit_gram_law : ∀ {n : ℕ},\n  1 ≤ n →\n    ∀ (G : FSC.Mat n),\n      WeakSimplex.IsCorrelation G →\n        ¬Matrix.PosDef G →\n          ∃ v,\n            (∀ (i : Fin n), ‖v i‖ = 1) ∧\n              Matrix.gram ℝ v = G ∧\n                MeasureTheory.Measure.map (fun y => WeakSimplex.Coord.ofFun fun i => inner ℝ (v i) y)\n                    (ProbabilityTheory.stdGaussian (FSC.Coord (n - 1))) =\n                  ProbabilityTheory.multivariateGaussian 0 G","endPos":{"column":6,"line":4},"fileName":"/home/abhmul/dev/full-simplex-conjecture-lean/checks/wp12/Audit.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":4},"severity":"information"}
